  </section>
  <section style="padding-top:0">
    <div class="wrap">
      <article class="tribute reveal" style="padding:44px">
        <p class="meta">Tribute</p>
        <h3 style="font-size:40px">Prof. Damien Sagrillo</h3>
        <p style="font-size:18px;max-width:760px">The Institute of Musicology and the Arts pays tribute to Prof. Damien Sagrillo, whose vision, leadership and scholarship were instrumental in shaping the Institute during its formative years. Since its creation in 2021, Prof. Sagrillo played a central role in establishing a strong research profile dedicated to the study and valorisation of Luxembourg’s musical heritage. His legacy continues to shape our work today.</p>
      </article>
